{"id": 2, "text": "三阳之正气太一之真精。名曰弱水。内有元龟。所 以 至于左肾。属乎阴而应月。主七魄。降精黑、而镇金关。此盖阳以阴为本。必禀生而在右者 也。乃若女子所生。则居命门于左肾。属乎阴而应月。主七魄。降精黑而镇元宫。元宫者胞 胎所系也。上黑下赤。左白右青。中央黄运其中。三阴之正气。太一之真精。名曰原泉。内 有蛇。所以呼吸元气。营运百脉。为三焦之原。而应于荣也。荣为阴。行于脉。故女子命 门在乎左肾。至于右肾。则属乎阳而应日。主三魂。降精赤而镇玉关。此盖阴以阳为本。必 禀生 按藏教、父母及子有相感业。神乃入胎。根据地水火风。众缘和合。渐得生长。一七日如 藕根 两 四相 五脏 四七 百吸 名毛 根清 二手 肉。", "entities": [{"id": 21, "label": "VIS", "start_offset": 48, "end_offset": 50}, {"id": 22, "label": "CON", "start_offset": 53, "end_offset": 54}, {"id": 23, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 57, "end_offset": 58}, {"id": 24, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 61, "end_offset": 63}, {"id": 25, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 66, "end_offset": 68}, {"id": 26, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 71, "end_offset": 73}, {"id": 27, "label": "CON", "start_offset": 79, "end_offset": 80}, {"id": 28, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 92, "end_offset": 93}, {"id": 29, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 95, "end_offset": 97}, {"id": 30, "label": "ACU", "start_offset": 99, "end_offset": 101}, {"id": 31, "label": "VIS", "start_offset": 104, "end_offset": 106}, {"id": 32, "label": "CON", "start_offset": 109, "end_offset": 110}, {"id": 33, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 113, "end_offset": 114}, {"id": 34, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 117, "end_offset": 119}, {"id": 35, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 122, "end_offset": 124}, {"id": 36, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 127, "end_offset": 129}, {"id": 37, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 133, "end_offset": 135}, {"id": 38, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 136, "end_offset": 137}, {"id": 39, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 139, "end_offset": 140}, {"id": 40, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 142, "end_offset": 143}, {"id": 41, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 145, "end_offset": 146}, {"id": 42, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 148, "end_offset": 150}, {"id": 43, "label": "CON", "start_offset": 152, "end_offset": 154}, {"id": 44, "label": "BEC", "start_offset": 157, "end_offset": 162}, {"id": 45, "label": "BDP", "start_offset": 165, "end