{"id": 3, "text": "日血 行 十 乐 下 自然生十一种风开通集成。使之筋脉肌骨。机关孔窍。皆得流通。然后得成为人。然则父 母生育。功侔造化。其为恩也。岂曰小哉。又以道书言之。玉清之气。生人上一。是为泥丸。上清之气。生人中一。是为绛宫。太 清之 百六 西方 量妙 胞命黄演之气下添。乃至第九月。无想无结无爱天岳府命元。自是气不添。夫九气既添。又 有六甲之神。相为保卫而全成之。夫所谓六甲神者。甲子水神。为之调畅血脉。润泽三焦。甲戌土神。为之调理肌肉。使不偏枯。甲申金神。为之紧固爪齿。养育真牙。甲午火神。为 之和悦五脏。混合百神。甲辰风神。为之保固胎息。呼吸阴阳。甲寅木神。为之濯炼筋骨。通贯百骸。信知妇人妊娠。谓之六甲者。", "entities": [{"id": 75, "label": "BEC", "start_offset": 156, "end_offset": 159}, {"id": 76, "label": "BEC", "start_offset": 164, "end_offset": 168}, {"id": 77, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 170, "end_offset": 174}, {"id": 78, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 175, "end_offset": 179}, {"id": 79, "label": "BEC", "start_offset": 180, "end_offset": 184}, {"id": 80, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 186, "end_offset": 190}, {"id": 81, "label": "SYM", "start_offset": 192, "end_offset": 195}, {"id": 82, "label": "BEC", "start_offset": 196, "end_offset": 200}, {"id": 83, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 202, "end_offset": 206}, {"id": 84, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 207, "end_offset": 211}, {"id": 85, "label": "BEC", "start_offset": 212, "end_offset": 216}, {"id": 86, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 218, "end_offset": 222}, {"id": 87, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 223, "end_offset": 227}, {"id": 88, "label": "BEC", "start_offset": 228, "end_offset": 232}, {"id": 89, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 234, "end_offset": 238}, {"id": 90, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 239, "end_offset": 243}, {"id": 91, "label": "BEC", "start_offset": 244, "end_offset": 248}, {"id": 92, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 250, "end_offset": 254}, {"id": 93, "label": "SIG", "start_offset": 255, "end_offset": 259}, {"id": 94, "label": "DIS", "start_offset": 263, "end_offset": 267}], "relations": [{"id": 42, "from_id": 76, "to_id": 77, "type": "perf"}, {"id": 43, "from_id": 76, "to_id": 78, "type": "perf"}, {"id": 44, "from_id": 79, "to_id": 80, "type": "perf"}, {"id": 45, "from_id": 79, "to_id": 81, "type": "assist_diag"}, {"id": 46, "from_id": 82, "to_id": 83, "type": "perf"}, {"